WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.724
A working agreement people can use In this learning

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:07.092
activity you will build a clear support partnership You

00:00:07.145 --> 00:00:09.934
will identify the limits of your own authority and

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:14.262
practise using sound judgement when requests compete You will

00:00:14.289 --> 00:00:17.447
also learn to prepare work that meets agreed requirements

00:00:17.486 --> 00:00:20.315
and to check that another person has actually accepted

00:00:20.355 --> 00:00:26.237
any cover assignment Translate priorities into reliable support deliverables

00:00:27.171 --> 00:00:32.711
Distinguish EA coordination from executive and specialist decisions Prepare

00:00:32.763 --> 00:00:36.868
a working agreement and a reasoned priority brief Keep

00:00:36.921 --> 00:00:40.342
uncertainty visible rather than inventing approval
